title : tcsin1
	
	                          TCS
                               ----------
	hi friends,
		
		 i hope you received my previous mail regarding 
		 TCS test pattern.
		
		 here is the second phase of my mail about 
		 commonly asked questions.
		
		 1. tell us about yourself ?
		
		 2. how do you rate your knowledge  in C LANGUAGE 
		    on 0 - 10 scale.
		               (or)
		    what is your software proficiency ?
		 
		 3. questions related to your seminars presented (or)
		    projects done.
		
		 4.  questions about your  PLUS points
		                          MINUS points
		 
		 5.  about your hobbies
		
		 6   do you have any problems if you get a chance to 
		     go abroad ?
		 
		     these are the commonly asked questions.
		     you may get some more .it depends on your style 
		     of preparing BIO-DATA form.
		
		     the last and important question is ..
		     YES.. it's about 2- minutes talk.
		     
		     in most cases but by no means always choice will be 
		     given to us for selecting a topic.
		
		     the general topics are: 
		         
		     T2K
		     MULTIMEDIA
		     CD-ROM
		     LAN
		     WAN
		     INTERNET
		     INTRANET
		     NUCLEAR TESTS & SANCTIONS .etc.
		    
		     normally what they expect from you is..
		         your communication skills
		                    &
		         your way of presenting technical topics.
		     
		     even though it's a 2-minutes talk,you can stop that
		     within one minute, provided if you did well in this 
		     one minute.
		  
		     my advice to you is..
		     just know some thing about all the topics mentioned 
		     above.
		     but select some advaned topics like any one among the
		     following 3 topics ;
		     
		     1. features of WINDOWS- 98
		       (read JAN 22-nd ,Hindu magazine,Science & Technology)
		
		     2. features of E-commerce
		       (read Computers Magazine -june issue
		                  &
		        march 12 ,hindu,science & technology     
		        may 18, hindu ,business pages )
		     
		     3.  Geographic Information Systems(GIS) which has
		         many applications in 
		                        Transportation Engg 
		                               &
		                Hydraulics and Water Resources Engg
		                               & 
		                Urban Planning and Urban Management 
		         
		       
		        (read Dec 18,1997, Hindu ,Science & Technology
		                     &
		              Jan 22, Hindu ,Science & Technology)
		     
		     
		         i completed this in hurry manner.
		       
		         any way i hope this will help you to some extent.
		
		         Generally the interview time will vary between
		         15 to 20 minutes..at the most 25 minutes.
		         so start preparing answers for the above mentioned 
		         questions from now on wards,so that you can present 
		         them confidently. 
		                  
		         Bye
		         with LOVE
		         Subrov   
	i***********************************************
			    guduru suresh kumar
